Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.85,0:00:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)做好忏悔的准备了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼·光子·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.29,0:00:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这些家伙的攻击可伤不到这「杰尼亚斯」！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 心园真正的姿态{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.47,0:00:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.92 心园·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 那家伙的场上会出现新的 No.！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我来告诉愚蠢的你们吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.32,0:00:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去超量单位的心园
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.07,0:01:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.25,0:01:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将心园作为超量单位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.35,0:01:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤心园·龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.55,0:01:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 这只怪兽特殊召唤成功的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.98,0:01:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方的攻击表示怪兽全部变成守备表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.21,0:01:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，向杰尼亚斯胆敢反抗的愚者们。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在哈特艾斯·龙面前给我跪伏吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.50,0:01:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在伤害到达之前，我们的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.15,0:01:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就被变成守备表示了么。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以攻击才被无效了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.82,0:01:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.26,0:01:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然还有这种能力！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.12,0:01:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了，陷阱卡发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.37,0:01:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虚假形态！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.65,0:01:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡，是让你们这些家伙的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.72,0:01:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成守备表示后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.21,0:01:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予400点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.60,0:01:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:01:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:01:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.73,0:02:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下这1200点伤害吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动光子栗子的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.42,0:02:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡从手牌送入墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}支付自己一半的生命值……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.62,0:02:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(光子栗子)栗栗……！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.22,0:02:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)将效果伤害无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.11,0:02:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}栗～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.24,0:02:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.64,0:02:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你难道身体已经！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别吵！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)我还没到燃尽的时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.79,0:02:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在打倒Dr.费卡之前！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.21,0:02:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.91,0:02:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是你就此倒下本可以不必受苦的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.84,0:02:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.09,0:02:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想打倒我！？你听不见吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是逼近眼前的败北脚步声。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.55,0:02:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星界世界灭亡的鼓动！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.58,0:03:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心地球·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.29,0:03:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击鲨鱼·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.79,0:03:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以攻击力零进行攻击！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.44,0:03:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心地球·龙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会在战斗中破坏 并且{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.45,0:03:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将因战斗产生的伤害无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本来由我承受的伤害全部由你们承受！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.71,0:03:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.19,0:03:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此 攻击力零的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.32,0:03:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击守备力2100的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.61,0:03:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼·龙的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.14,0:03:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到的伤害 本来是2100。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.81,0:03:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其全部无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后反弹到这边来吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.98,0:03:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的生命值是 600。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.83,0:03:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去2100的要是吃了伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！心碎加农炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.67,0:03:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.46,0:05:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想得逞，陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}逃脱·诱饵！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)这张卡可以将敌人的攻击对象
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.98,0:05:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变更为其他怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将战斗中产生的伤害减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将攻击对象变更为霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.03,0:05:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货！你这么做有什么意义！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.97,0:05:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么把霍普作为攻击对象！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.65,0:05:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 快察觉到…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.45,0:05:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要减少那家伙的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们受到的伤害也会减少！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.05,0:05:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:05:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！半·破！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:05:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:06:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将战斗中的伤害减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把这个效果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用在心之地龙身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把保护自己的陷阱用在我的怪兽上？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.13,0:06:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！因为对你的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.32,0:06:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害减半了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.24,0:06:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反弹到我们身上的伤害也会减轻！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.16,0:06:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来心之地龙的伤害就是500！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.48,0:06:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此我们受到的伤害也是500！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.57,0:06:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 垂死挣扎吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但就在这一刻 心之地龙的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.41,0:06:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进一步效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:06:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因战斗产生的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.67,0:07:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我的伤害将无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并相应地回复生命值！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.99,0:07:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.18,0:07:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家……加油啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.80,0:07:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有的希望 就寄托在你们身上了……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 凌牙。亏你撑到现在。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都这副德性了还这么高高在上啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.15,0:07:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶…我们的生命值只剩100了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.15,0:07:31.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)怎么了游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.15,0:07:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是想说丧气话就给我躺那儿去。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦… 才、才不是什么丧气话！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.42,0:07:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能放弃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.28,0:07:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光在等着我的帮助！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.25,0:07:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定要…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.60,0:07:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你救出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.53,0:07:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃起来了！ 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.19,0:07:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.23,0:08:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看着吧星光！ 上吧希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.66,0:08:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将希望皇霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为超量素材进行混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将混沌化为光明的使者。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.44,0:08:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！ CNo.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.53,0:08:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Dr.费卡)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.69,0:08:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo. No.的新力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.50,0:08:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但凭这种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是打不倒我的热血龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《确实热血龙会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.76,0:08:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把伤害反弹给我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.69,0:08:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.22,0:08:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定有什么办法。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.11,0:08:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想想…… 快想啊……》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.45,0:08:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.44,0:08:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～ 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.69,0:08:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑混沌斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于死心了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.70,0:09:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然自己把生命值扔进泥里。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁会放弃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动速攻魔法我我我冲刺！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}枪弹连击是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.20,0:09:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽之间进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.30,0:09:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己怪兽的攻击力变为0{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对手玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成600点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.02,0:09:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此 你还算动了点脑子。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然攻击不行就用效果削生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.33,0:09:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区600点也敢乱来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.06,0:09:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用我们的力量 用羁绊绝对要打倒那家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.75,0:09:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《撑住啊……》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.31,0:10:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个瞬间心之地龙的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.30,0:10:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽特殊召唤之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.01,0:10:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手场上召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.37,0:10:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或者盖放的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.61,0:10:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在下个回合被除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的希望皇竟然……！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！羁绊？无聊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西不过是幻想罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.01,0:10:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果真有的话就让我见识见识。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.75,0:10:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们所谓的羁绊之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.15,0:10:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的确，羁绊这东西不是肉眼能看见的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.88,0:10:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而是在更深更深的心底紧紧相连的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要它一直存在心意就一定能传达到！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.67,0:10:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将海咬龙鲨·龙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.95,0:10:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以鲨·龙作为超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.61,0:11:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤 CNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.32！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)海咬龙鲨·龙·逆袭！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我也不放弃。我一定会做到给你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用我自己的方式 燃起来！》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深海攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以通过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.09,0:11:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将攻击力2000以上的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性怪兽1只
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.17,0:11:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 让自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.03,0:11:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽可以进行直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.29,0:11:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我送去墓地的是 乔兹曼！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 鲨鱼龙恐惧利维坦的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击就成为可能了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.05,0:11:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼龙恐惧利维坦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.80,0:11:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对Dr.费卡直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊混沌撕咬！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.14,0:11:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}避开心脏龙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.97,0:11:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击费卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.45,0:12:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得好 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.03,0:12:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.53,0:12:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虚假生命！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Dr.费卡)这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以无效直接攻击造成的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.57,0:12:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 回复那个数值的生命…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.14,0:12:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡那家伙又把生命值给加上去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.33,0:12:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 我盖一张卡 回合… …。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.63,0:12:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}… 回合结束…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.03,0:12:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙… 因为拜隆的计谋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.59,0:12:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去了自尊和妹妹{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道还要在这里悲惨地连自己也失去吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！ 喂 你怎么了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不是受伤了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.64,0:12:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没什么大不了的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.97,0:12:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.92,0:12:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.38,0:13:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的心意… 我确实收到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.96,0:13:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你还是不明白啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园龙 效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.85,0:13:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你们的卡除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失吧 鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.45,0:13:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 证明给我看！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.39,0:13:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}证明你们所谓的羁绊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.51,0:13:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.97,0:13:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我等这一刻很久了菲卡博士！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.27,0:13:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}中招的是你才对！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.43,0:13:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.55,0:13:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.50,0:13:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量次元飞溅！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡被敌人除外时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.89,0:13:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组把 等级8的水属性怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.01,0:13:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤２只。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.91,0:14:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除外发动的陷阱卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将２只
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.39,0:14:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}渊鲨·超巨齿鲨{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.01,0:14:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这个效果特殊召唤的怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.01,0:14:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.41,0:14:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既不能攻击也不能解放！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.03,0:14:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是说，反过来利用了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.90,0:14:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园龙的的效果吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.81,0:14:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心意必定会传达到。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.20,0:14:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，这就是我托付给你的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最后的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.59,0:14:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.11,0:14:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级８的银河眼和
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.02,0:14:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}２只超巨齿鲨叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用３只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.87,0:14:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.93,0:15:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}汹涌翻腾的银河啊此刻化作怒涛之光{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.79,0:15:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现出你的身姿吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.32,0:15:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧 我的灵魂！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.61,0:15:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了 快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么能在这种地方就此终结…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.48,0:15:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 凌牙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.15,0:15:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 我的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.21,0:15:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼 效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.44,0:15:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张怪兽召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.00,0:15:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将除此以外的 所有怪兽效果无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.61,0:15:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子咆哮！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.62,0:16:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.93,0:16:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 银河眼龙的效果就无效了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.56,0:16:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更进一步通过使用1个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上的所有怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.19,0:16:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的超量单元吸收！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.21,0:16:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 这个回合的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每吸收1个超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.68,0:16:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力5000！ 怎么可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.31,0:16:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Dr.费卡 我要亲手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.53,0:16:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你重获新生！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.39,0:16:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做好忏悔的准备了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货！ 区区一个毛头小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新生银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.73,0:16:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终极光子流！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了！ 给费卡造成了巨大伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.55,0:17:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放弃吧 Dr.费卡。已经结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}立刻把哈尔特放了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.06,0:17:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙…… 知道自己在做什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.59,0:17:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.08,0:17:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.40,0:17:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了让哈鲁特活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就只能毁灭阿斯特拉尔世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.60,0:17:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这……这到底是怎么回事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.65,0:17:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特如果没有巴利安的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.43,0:17:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本活不下来。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.60,0:17:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.06,0:17:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特天生就是个虚弱的孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.04,0:17:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他那生命之火
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.56,0:17:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}随时都像是快要熄灭一样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}微弱不堪。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.17,0:18:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为如此，我为了救那条命{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.25,0:18:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不得不前往异世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.21,0:18:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为此才把老爸和特隆……！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我决定要救哈鲁特的时候就舍弃了一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}朋友也好 同伴也好……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.03,0:18:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜隆 还有一马。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.72,0:18:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把他们当作祭品我成功打开了那扇门。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.81,0:18:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在门后等待着的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.09,0:18:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是巴利安。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.85,0:18:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们的世界是不存在实体的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}某种能量世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.77,0:18:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们拥有这个世界所没有的高层次的能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和他们做了交易。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为获得让哈鲁特活下去的力量的代价
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要毁灭星界世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.00,0:18:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我收集数字卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:19:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用那股力量通过球形力场炮{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将星界世界歼灭殆尽。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果不遵守那个约定{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.81,0:19:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙迟早会他们会来夺走哈鲁特吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那是真的的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.42,0:19:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 你不说啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.72,0:19:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不出口……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.46,0:19:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一旦说了 你必定会{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}独自一人 将那罪业背负起来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.42,0:19:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直很感激 凯特……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.02,0:19:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你什么也没说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.28,0:19:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为 No.猎人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.01,0:19:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为哈鲁特而战。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.64,0:19:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我不想 再让你继续痛苦下去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.60,0:19:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.64,0:19:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那不对。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:19:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么不相信家人！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.40,0:20:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么相信那些家伙却不相信我！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.48,0:20:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.69,0:20:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那些家伙要取哈鲁特的命的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.29,0:20:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来保护哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对会保护好他！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.28,0:20:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪怕搭上这条命！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.71,0:20:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特，我也来帮忙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.53,0:20:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么结界结界的我是不懂啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.25,0:20:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我跟你一起把他们揍飞！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.22,0:20:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也来。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夏克！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.09,0:20:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别误会了。我跟那些家伙有笔账要算。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来把他们打趴下！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.13,0:20:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要我们三个齐心协力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.90,0:20:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么结界根本不在话下！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.25,0:20:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.65,0:20:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.24,0:20:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经不用再舍弃任何东西了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.31,0:20:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要相信我们就够了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.65,0:20:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们会把一切统统做个了断！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:20:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.56,0:21:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}≪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Dr.菲卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.23,0:21:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Dr.菲卡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.70,0:21:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.75,0:21:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.99,0:21:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别过来！别过来～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.52,0:21:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.35,0:21:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了！？爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.03,0:21:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还以为你能再多撑一会儿呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.27,0:21:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.们！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马。天城快斗。神代凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.45,0:21:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗还没有分出胜负。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.18,0:21:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是谁！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.72,0:21:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我正是巴利安。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.41,0:21:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安！？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.58,0:23:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.68,0:23:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.94,0:23:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.91,0:23:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.37,0:23:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.37,0:23:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.20,0:23:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.42,0:24:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.53,0:24:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.13,0:24:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.66,0:24:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.52,0:24:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷。鲨鱼龙·贝斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.46,0:24:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.众合计是 多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.15,0:24:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷是 39。鲨鱼龙·贝斯是 32。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.06,0:24:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河是 呃……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.86,0:24:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案是 71。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.76,0:24:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河并不是 No.众。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.11,0:24:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是陷阱啊。

